**File:** `public/styles.css` (only file created/edited; 14.5 KB, braces balanced 0/0, at-rules limited to `@supports`/`@media`/`@keyframes`).

**Selectors implemented (all within CONTRACT §8 scope):**
- Contract hooks: `.page`, `.hero`, `.card`, `.card h1`, `.message`, `.status`, `.card[data-state="loading"|"ready"|"error"]` and their descendants.
- Pseudo-elements/derived only: `.page::before`/`::after` (aurora + veil), `.card::before` (top sheen), `.card[data-state="error"]::after` (red tint wash), `.status::before` (state dot), `.message:empty`, `:focus-visible`, `:root` tokens. No new markup required — verified against the shipped `public/index.html` hooks (`body.page` / `main.hero` / `section.card[data-state]` / `p#message.message` / `p#status.status`).

**State treatments:**
- `loading` — `.message` becomes a pill-shaped skeleton (`min-height` matched to the display type) with a travelling `shimmer` sweep; `.status` breathes (opacity pulse). `.message:empty` stays rendered only in this state.
- `ready` — calm: gradient-clipped display type with a slow `hue-glide`, green status dot, inset hairline highlight, no motion noise.
- `error` — red-tinted border + radial wash, red gradient headline, and `.status` reframed as a legible monospace pill (sentence case, no letter-spacing) for error text.

**Design:** self-contained system-font stack; full-viewport four-blob mesh aurora (violet / cyan / pink / mint) drifting over 34 s behind a centred glassmorphism card (`backdrop-filter: blur()` behind `@supports`, with an opaque fallback background), layered soft shadows, 28 px radius. Fluid `clamp()` type throughout, uppercase letter-spaced micro-labels for `h1`/`.status`, staggered fade+rise entrance on hero → card → heading → message → status. Breakpoints at 640 px, 1024 px, plus a short-viewport (`max-height: 460px`) adjustment. Dark mode overrides tokens only (deep navy base, softened aurora, lighter gradient stops, darkened veil). `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` disables every animation/transition and swaps the shimmer for a static skeleton; `:focus-visible` gives a 2 px offset ring in both palettes.

**Wished-for hook:** none — the contract's hooks were sufficient. (A wrapper around `#message` would have allowed a separate skeleton element rather than restyling `.message` itself, but the current approach needs no markup change.)


